:''For the other Asuka from the same event, see [[Asuka Cat (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Asuka Langley''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was obtained in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.7 Update#Update 8.7.5|Version 8.7.5]] increases health and attack power and grants the ability to [[Knockback|Knockback]] [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies.

